# BUGS

The cases of the full feature set run on the Vulkan backend only; the Mali backend runs the checks above.
It judges the rasterizer's rules only where a case is built to be exact (rectangles aligned to pixels, whose shared diagonal is covered once); a pixel on a slanted edge is not judged.
The MSAA edge assumes a sample pattern that is symmetric about the pixel's centre in x, as every standard pattern is.
Storage images, geometry and tessellation, multiview, counted draws, queries, anisotropy, compressed formats and depth resolves are printed as features but not drawn here.
